  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。赤いパプリカと　味の差は　特にないがミックスして　使えば　目にも　おいしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓴맛이 나는 식재료. 빨간 파프리카와 맛의 차이는 거의 없으나 섞어서 사용하면 보기에도 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有苦味的食材。味道和紅椒並無特別差異，不過混合使用會更加美觀。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût amer. Sa saveur est proche du poivron rouge, mais le mélange des variétés aux couleurs différentes est aussi un régal pour les yeux.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese bittere Zutat unterscheidet sich im Geschmack nicht sehr von Roter Paprika, doch mischt man die verschiedenfarbigen Sorten, freut sich das Auge.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiene un sabor amargo casi idéntico a su variante roja, pero, al mezclarlos, la variedad de colores da muy buen aspecto a cualquier comida.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente amaro dal sapore simile a quello del Peperone rosso. Mischiarli crea una festa di colori.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An ingredient with some bitterness. It’s not much different from its red counterpart in flavor, but mixing the colors makes a feast for the eyes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "苦味が　ある　食材。赤いパプリカと　味の差は　特にないがミックスして　使えば　目にも　おいしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有苦味的食材。味道与红椒几乎无异，但混合起来用便能给人带来视觉享受。",
